<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><a href="/island-claim-tools/">Claim tools</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</span></nav><p class="tag">Free calculator</p><h1>RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator for Property Claims</h1><p class="lede">Replacement cost policies usually pay in two stages: actual cash value now and recoverable depreciation after repairs. List your items to see how the money splits.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="dep">
